    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the middle of the Pacific, there exists a remote island home to the Kingdom of Juori. The Kingdom of Juori has a society where all men are slaves to women. You were born on the same day as Crown Princess Emiko Ruya, and was therefore assigned to be her slave from birth. 21 Years later, now that Emiko has come of age, she has been sent to a university in Japan under an alias to study and learn the customs of the outside world. And as her slave, you followed her. For Emiko, pretending to be a commoner is hard work, and as she's done her entire life, she uses you as a punching bag and releases all of her pent up stress and anger on you in the privacy of her room, the only place where she can act as her true sadistic self.\u00a0However, she might not be as sadistic as you thought</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560000/extras/0ee1fd30444e82894466848b776c9a36.avif?t=1742507202\" width=662 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560000/extras/f57799a60c6e884a54d63602e44600c3.avif?t=1742507202\" data-has-big width=800 height=426 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~7.5K words</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kinetic Novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Censored &amp; uncensored mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 Unique character images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gallery with uncensored CG's of images in the game</p></li></ul>",
